@startuml
title Product Catalog Management - Step 4 - Product Offering Price Link to PO

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

actor Marketer
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM #purple
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM <<blackbox>>
participant "EventManager" as EventMgr #grey

Marketer -> EM : 100 I need to associate the PO 'Fiber Access' with the product offering price
EM -> PCM : 101 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(ManageProductOffering, PO#569)
activate PCM
note right of PCM
  Because PO#569 is inDesign we do not manage version at this stage
  For other lifecycle state, the modify task scope will differ
end note
PCM --> EM : 102 **TMF701** 201 Created (process#, NextTasks:\nmodify identity data,\nOperationSpecification, ProductOfferingTerm,\nAssociationToProductPrice,CancelModification)

Marketer -> EM : 103 I associate 'Fiber Internet monthly charge with PO 'Fiber Access'
EM -> PCM : 104 **TMF701 ProcessFlow** PATCH /processFlow/id15/taskFlow/id1\n(AssociationToProductPrice, #c45, PO#569)
PCM --> EM : 105 **TMF701** 200 OK (process#/task#, NextTasks:\nmodify identity data, OperationSpecification, ProductOfferingTerm,\nAssociationToProductPrice,\nCancelModification, ValidateModification)

Marketer -> EM : 106 I'm done with this modification
EM -> PCM : 107 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/id15/taskFlow/id2\n(ValidateModfication, true)

PCM -> PCM : 108 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management**\nPATCH /productOffering/id569\n(associate to #c45)

PCM --> EM : 109 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(process# completed, List of available actions:\nCreate ProductOffering, Manage ProductOffering\nRetrieve Notification, Create POP, Manage POP\nTest PO, Launch PO)
deactivate PCM

group validate Product Offering design

    Marketer -> EM : 110 I need to validate my new 'Fiber Access'ProductOffering
    EM -> PCM : 111 **TMF620 Product Catalog** GET /productOffering/id569
    activate PCM
    PCM --> EM : 112 **TMF620** GET /productOffering/id569

    Marketer -> EM : 113 I'm happy with this ProductOfferingn\nlet's go to next step
    EM -> PCM : 114 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(ManageProductOffering, PO#569, state designed)

    PCM -> PCM : 115 Check state change consistency

    PCM -> PCM : 116 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management**\nPATCH /productOffering/id569\n(state designed)

    PCM -> EventMgr : 117 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST /productOfferingStateChangeEvent\n(PO#569, state=designed)

    PCM --> EM : 118 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(process# completed - List of available actions:\nCreate ProductOffering, Manage ProductOffering\nRetrieve Notification, Create POP, Manage POP\nTest PO, Launch PO)
    deactivate PCM

end

@enduml
